<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stanley Works started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stanley Works started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Stanley Works with a strong buy rating due to the strength of the company's new management.</p>
<p>-- set a target price of $45-$50 a share.</p>
<p>-- Stanley Works gained 1-5/8 to 36-1/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
